      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm doing a paper for my art history class on deconstruction in modern art. i feel like lately everything is just about the political message instead of actually being beautiful or well-made. how much do u think this trend of prioritizing politics over aesthetics has hurt the actual value of contemporary art?",
